BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (        aveler's radical trust, returned ten golden acorns, keeping five for the labor of wateri) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        ng.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
