BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (        d the spirits withdrew their favor. The garden withered, leaving only dust. The lesson e) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (        ndures: when one offers their all, they invite the universe to multiply their fortune. T) Tj ET
