BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      In the Orchard of Echoes, a traveler carried five golden seeds-the sum of his journey. He ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (        met the Guardian, a spirit of clay and wind. To grow the orchard, the traveler had to su) Tj ET
