BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      In the beginning, the world was a tangle of frayed ends, each soul clutching its own porti) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        on of starlight. Aster, the Weaver, stood at the center of the void. She possessed a gol) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        den spool, but it was useless alone. To create the tapestry of existence, she had to rel) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (        ease her thread into the dark, trusting that others would catch it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
