BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      In the dawn of the First Age, two spirits, Aethel and Thorne, guarded the valley of the Si) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        lver Mist. Aethel held five golden embers, the seeds of prosperity. Thorne held the fert) Tj ET
