BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (         weaving into a shimmering canopy of light, tripling in brilliance. Thorne watched the g) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        low, his heart stirred by the gift. He knew the embers could grant him power, but he als) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        o remembered the bridge Aethel had built. He gathered the light, keeping only what was n) Tj ET
