BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        th yielded nothing for the greedy, but bloomed in abundance for those who understood the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (         cycle of the gift. From that day, the valley flourished, for Aethel and Thorne realized) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (         that to hold onto the light was to lose it, but to cast it forward was to possess the w) Tj ET
