BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        met the Guardian, a spirit of clay and wind. To grow the orchard, the traveler had to su) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (        rrender his seeds to the Guardian's soil. "If you plant these," the traveler said, "they) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (         shall bloom threefold, but only if you tend to them with an open palm.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      The Guardian accepted the seeds, and beneath his touch, they swelled into shimmering stalk) Tj ET
