BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (        rchard: cycles are sustained by flow, not stagnation. He returned a portion of the light) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (         to the traveler, ensuring the traveler's survival for the next season. The traveler, no) Tj ET
