BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        sed her silk across the void. It doubled in the air, catching the light of the sun-a gif) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        t of faith. The Merchant, seeing this, did not hoard. He returned a portion of the doubl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        ed grain back across the chasm. Through this act of vulnerability, the void between them) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (         vanished, and the fields flourished. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      They learned that the secret of growth lay not in keeping what one has, but in the gamble ) Tj ET
