BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      In the beginning, the world was a tangle of frayed ends, each soul clutching its own porti) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        on of starlight. Aster, the Weaver, stood at the center of the void. She possessed a gol) Tj ET
