BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      Some souls, however, kept the gold for their own pockets, letting the tapestry remain unfi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        nished, dark and cold. Aster learned that the loom required a circle: one must cast, one) Tj ET
