BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (        her day alone. If he poured it into the Traveler's parched earth, the seeds-blessed by a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (        ncient gods-would yield a harvest tripled in size. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      The Keeper hesitated, his throat dry, watching the Traveler's cracked lips. He chose to tr) Tj ET
