BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        ed half to the Keeper, ensuring both thrived. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      Thus, the Law of the Basin was born: wealth held in isolation is a stagnant pool, but shar) Tj ET
