BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      In the valley of the Silver Mist, the cycle of the gift became the law of the land. It was) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (         not enough to merely send; one had to acknowledge the echo of the return. If Aster sent) Tj ET
