BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        y individual thread could ever be. They discovered that the game was not about profit, b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        ut about the preservation of the bond between them. Every act of generosity was a stitch) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (         in time, weaving a future where the shadows could never encroach. As they stood togethe) Tj ET
