BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      to a shared shield or to hoard the cooling iron for themselves.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (    Yet, the forge has a memory. It remembers every strike and every silence. When the receiver ) Tj ET
